                "fragment O hl2() { return {float4(0,1,1,1),float4(0,1,1,1),float4(0,1,1,1)}; } fragment O hl3() { return {float4(1,1,0,1),float4(1,1,0,1),float4(1,1,0,1)}; }\n"
