            "%d of them hold one of the %d uniform shadows taken from that submission on%s", bad ? "[RED] " : "", added, (unsigned long long)logs,
            (unsigned long long)miss, learned, age_lo < 1e30 ? age_lo : -1.0, age_hi, shadowed, nr,
